          <![CDATA[7404-DF-001  Flame detector pump house - Hi Alarm C_E | GE address %M00388 (BOOL), initial 0, retentive NO]]>
        </Description>
      </Tag>
      <Tag Name="DF_7404_001_FRUP" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL">
